From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] git push: make sign-on-push accept a revset

Let users define signing policy with the same revset language used by
other jj configuration. Intersect the configured selector with commits
outgoing to the pushed references and force-sign exactly the selected
commits.

Default to none(). Configurations must use an explicit revset.
