@@ -12,6 +12,9 @@ to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.
 
 ### Breaking changes
 
+* `git.sign-on-push` is now a revset selecting commits to sign instead of a
+  boolean. The default is `none()`. Boolean values are no longer accepted.
+
 ### Deprecations
 
